UPDATE `creature_text` SET `Text` = 'Cenarius fights at my side. Illidan sits atop his throne in the Outland - brooding. I am afraid that the loss to Arthas proved to be his breaking point. Madness has embraced him, Remulos. He replays the events in his mind a thousand times per day, but in his mind, he is the victor and Arthas is utterly defeated. He is too far gone, old friend. I fear that the time may soon come that our bond is tested and it will not be as it was at the Well in Zin-Azshari. ', `Type` = 12, `Language` = 0, `Probability` = 100, `Emote` = 1, `Duration` = 0, `Sound` = 0, `BroadcastTextId` = 10876, `TextRange` = 0, `comment` = 'Malfurion Stormrage - say Text 3' WHERE `CreatureID` = 17949 AND `GroupID` = 3 AND `ID` = 0;

